WEBVTT

00:03.460 --> 00:04.570
Aes?

00:11.300 --> 00:12.830
Try me.

00:13.570 --> 00:15.300
Alcos of the Twin Heads?

00:16.340 --> 00:17.790
Why, Aes?!

00:18.270 --> 00:19.250
Answer me!

00:20.760 --> 00:24.340
Why do you always fail
to understand my intention?!

00:24.630 --> 00:27.060
How come my voice never reaches you?!

00:27.060 --> 00:30.420
Unfortunately, I'm really not
cut out to be a revolutionist.

00:30.420 --> 00:32.140
How feeble!

00:42.120 --> 00:44.860
This is what happens
when I heat things up.

00:52.490 --> 00:53.700
I've been waiting for ya.

00:53.980 --> 00:55.950
I'll link up with you soon.

00:56.220 --> 00:58.380
Be sure to get that ready.

00:59.180 --> 01:00.460
Prepare the Anti-Phaser.

01:07.670 --> 01:10.970
METALLIC ROUGE

02:43.940 --> 02:45.520
Chairman, we should hurry!

02:45.520 --> 02:46.100
Rouge!

02:46.450 --> 02:48.200
Brother, stay away!

02:54.820 --> 02:56.930
I haven't seen you in some time,

02:56.930 --> 02:59.700
and look at you, a VIP now, eh?

03:00.230 --> 03:02.210
And you're the same as usual...

03:02.210 --> 03:03.260
Graufon.

03:07.650 --> 03:09.130
We...

03:10.580 --> 03:12.090
...cannot change.

03:14.210 --> 03:17.700
Witness the castle thou hast built...

03:17.700 --> 03:19.540
...turn into shambles by flame.

03:20.010 --> 03:22.300
Your being verbose is just as usual.

03:25.730 --> 03:27.440
Close thy mouth...

03:28.740 --> 03:31.500
...and listen to the sound of doom.

03:37.310 --> 03:38.930
Rouge Redstar!

03:40.170 --> 03:41.660
Thou shalt exchange thy id...

03:41.660 --> 03:43.700
...with this man's life!

03:43.960 --> 03:45.830
Don't you dare touch him!

03:46.460 --> 03:48.700
O poor butcher which is thee.

03:48.700 --> 03:50.840
O killer of one's own.

03:51.800 --> 03:54.340
Hand over thy soul to me.

04:06.470 --> 04:08.200
Jet Black Noir?

04:08.200 --> 04:09.760
Name's Eden Varrock.

04:09.760 --> 04:12.540
I'd love to be called
my real name instead.

04:22.180 --> 04:22.780
Eden!

04:23.380 --> 04:25.240
I'll still let you live for now.

04:32.300 --> 04:33.380
Eden!

04:35.540 --> 04:39.090
You're going so far as to sacrifice yourself
for someone who kills our own kind?

04:39.400 --> 04:41.870
Is Eva's daughter
really that precious to you?

04:43.950 --> 04:46.780
I didn't want to see you like this.

05:09.860 --> 05:11.730
The pieces are all here.

05:12.590 --> 05:14.270
Give me back my brother!

05:19.440 --> 05:20.780
Just the right time.

05:24.740 --> 05:26.510
The Visitors' landing craft?!

05:35.170 --> 05:36.050
Go...

05:39.760 --> 05:40.610
That guy...

05:40.990 --> 05:42.320
He's still alive?!

05:43.540 --> 05:44.820
Jean!

05:45.140 --> 05:47.190
Go, Rouge...

06:00.570 --> 06:01.970
You're from earlier!

06:02.230 --> 06:04.780
I see you can fight
in that form now.

06:04.780 --> 06:07.310
Now, fight me!

06:10.220 --> 06:11.480
Out of my way!

06:11.780 --> 06:13.230
So you're in for this now!

06:14.730 --> 06:15.650
Jean!

06:19.050 --> 06:21.990
Enough distractions, Sister.

06:22.270 --> 06:23.610
Why are you in my way?!

06:28.600 --> 06:30.790
That's the spirit, Metal Rouge!

06:32.260 --> 06:35.170
I really must take it
into my own hands to take you down!

06:35.570 --> 06:36.950
They're on par with each other?

06:50.510 --> 06:52.060
They're resonating with each other.

06:52.770 --> 06:55.310
So they might actually be sisters...

06:55.920 --> 06:58.100
If we use Anti-Phaser in this situation,

06:58.100 --> 07:00.780
both Rouge and the blue girl
will be in danger...

07:02.360 --> 07:03.070
Rouge!

07:03.740 --> 07:05.910
Reverse the output phase!

07:06.550 --> 07:09.120
Reverse the phase!
Stop ignoring me!

07:09.660 --> 07:11.910
What nonsense are you talking about?

07:14.570 --> 07:16.460
I told you, enough distractions!

07:16.760 --> 07:18.470
Gah, what are you doing?!

07:18.470 --> 07:20.580
It's because you're yelling inside my head!

07:21.260 --> 07:22.580
Just hurry up!

07:22.580 --> 07:24.970
Listen to what I say!
Trust me!

07:24.970 --> 07:26.630
Like hell I could!

07:26.630 --> 07:27.510
Trust me!

07:27.510 --> 07:28.700
No way!

07:28.700 --> 07:29.430
Believe me.

07:30.040 --> 07:31.640
Gosh!

07:31.640 --> 07:33.350
Quit your yapping!

07:35.010 --> 07:37.100
What do you want me to do
with the phase?

07:37.100 --> 07:37.900
Reverse!

07:38.480 --> 07:39.850
Concentrate well!

07:39.850 --> 07:42.900
As if you're trying to deform
and become a Gladiator again!

07:43.190 --> 07:45.110
Huh?! But I'm already deforming!

07:45.110 --> 07:46.140
Just do it!

07:46.140 --> 07:46.910
Now!

07:46.910 --> 07:47.780
Focus!

07:47.780 --> 07:49.230
Argh!

07:49.230 --> 07:51.360
Focus...

07:51.360 --> 07:54.490
Focus... Focus...

07:54.490 --> 07:55.960
What are you...

07:55.960 --> 08:00.450
Focus... Focus...

08:00.450 --> 08:02.040
How impertinent!

08:02.040 --> 08:03.550
- Focus...
- Destroy!

08:03.550 --> 08:08.300
Focus... Focus...

08:08.560 --> 08:09.470
Deform!

08:23.350 --> 08:24.670
What just happened?

08:25.210 --> 08:26.450
Those two...

08:26.450 --> 08:30.120
Their generators when changing
into Gladiator Mode...

08:30.120 --> 08:32.418
..have the exact same frequency characteristics.

08:32.582 --> 08:33.490
Huh?

08:34.020 --> 08:38.418
So, if Rouge reverses her frequency phase,
and slams her power into the opponent,

08:39.821 --> 08:42.220
it can counterbalance their energies.

08:42.582 --> 08:44.600
I really don't get it.

08:44.600 --> 08:47.090
It just means they cancelled
each other's powers.

08:47.600 --> 08:50.630
It's basically the same principle
as this Anti-Phaser.

08:51.070 --> 08:54.810
Still, glad it turned out well.

08:55.370 --> 08:57.290
Don't you think it turned out too well?

08:57.290 --> 08:59.350
I could use that now.

09:05.580 --> 09:06.820
There is something...

09:07.140 --> 09:08.620
...I want to tell you.

09:09.620 --> 09:11.160
There's something...

09:11.680 --> 09:13.700
...I want to ask you too.

09:17.780 --> 09:19.000
Jean...

09:20.000 --> 09:23.000
#9 THE ONE WHO VISITED

09:25.020 --> 09:26.460
You made a good pair.

09:30.280 --> 09:32.960
You two should talk about it.

09:37.740 --> 09:42.230
The details on the armed terrorist attack
on the Ministry of Truth's HQ last night...

09:42.230 --> 09:44.710
- How's our sleeping princess doing?
-  are still not clear...

09:45.920 --> 09:47.920
She's still unconscious.

09:52.780 --> 09:56.220
They must be in the gods' place now.

09:56.690 --> 09:59.290
The Visitors aren't gods.

10:00.050 --> 10:01.940
40 years ago,

10:01.940 --> 10:05.750
humanity first made contact
with the intelligent extraterrestrial beings.

10:06.020 --> 10:07.800
In other words, aliens.

10:08.260 --> 10:11.010
Even now, they only show their faces...

10:11.010 --> 10:13.010
...to a handful of VIPs.

10:13.010 --> 10:17.300
Despite that, they still give heaps
of Over-Technology so generously.

10:18.830 --> 10:21.310
What makes them different from gods?

10:21.820 --> 10:23.770
Well, from a Nean's perspective,

10:24.400 --> 10:26.620
humans who made them...

10:26.620 --> 10:28.350
...are practically gods.

10:28.990 --> 10:32.440
The ones who actually made them
are Professor Roy Yunghart,

10:32.440 --> 10:34.200
and Professor Eva Christella.

10:34.200 --> 10:37.880
Not to mention,
the first Neans they created...

10:37.880 --> 10:39.760
The Proto Neans...

10:39.760 --> 10:43.830
...are absolutely different
from the mass-produced Neans.

10:44.670 --> 10:46.630
The Immortal Nine...

10:47.180 --> 10:50.780
They possess the capabilities
to surpass humanity.

10:51.500 --> 10:53.490
They had to make such things...

10:54.500 --> 10:57.580
From what I see,
it's just asking for trouble.

11:05.700 --> 11:07.560
Huh? What?!

11:07.840 --> 11:10.020
What are you doing?

11:10.020 --> 11:12.090
Oh, this?

11:12.090 --> 11:15.180
If I don't wear this,
they'll find out that I'm not human.

11:15.180 --> 11:16.450
What?

11:17.960 --> 11:19.950
So you're not human?

11:21.580 --> 11:24.390
Naomi Orthmann is not human.

11:24.710 --> 11:29.060
She's a Contact Nean made for the Visitors
to make contact with humanity.

11:29.060 --> 11:30.790
And that's me!

11:31.230 --> 11:32.710
Didn't I mention this before?

11:33.100 --> 11:34.590
Not even once...

11:34.590 --> 11:36.820
I guess it's because you never asked?

11:36.820 --> 11:39.140
You're just full of mysteries.

11:40.960 --> 11:42.980
So, what are we doing here?

11:43.540 --> 11:44.980
I told you, didn't I?

11:45.280 --> 11:47.210
There's something I want to tell you.

11:47.210 --> 11:49.740
Enough jumping through loops,
just tell me already.

11:49.740 --> 11:52.340
I'm sure they must want to say it in person.

11:52.340 --> 11:54.860
This is no time to be chatting around!

11:55.820 --> 11:56.590
There they are.

12:06.930 --> 12:07.920
Zenoa.

12:08.470 --> 12:11.500
The beings whom humans call the Visitors.

12:14.500 --> 12:15.860
So...

12:16.540 --> 12:17.500
They're mermaids?

12:22.250 --> 12:24.290
We, Zenoa,

12:24.290 --> 12:27.180
once possessed the form similar to humans.

12:27.930 --> 12:31.600
For optimal interstellar travel,

12:31.600 --> 12:35.340
we evolved through generations,
and became like this.

12:35.340 --> 12:36.940
Huh? What?

12:36.940 --> 12:39.560
They think you're asking them.

12:41.210 --> 12:42.550
I have brought Rouge Redstar,

12:42.980 --> 12:45.650
codename Metal Rouge,
to your presence.

12:45.650 --> 12:48.100
Understood, First.

12:48.100 --> 12:50.210
First? Who?

12:50.980 --> 12:55.060
I am the first Nean made by the Zenoa
to imitate the earthlings.

12:55.530 --> 12:57.300
Hence the nickname, First.

12:58.360 --> 13:01.570
She calls herself Naomi Orthmann now.

13:02.140 --> 13:04.790
So your real name is First?

13:04.790 --> 13:06.640
I am Naomi Orthmann.

13:06.640 --> 13:07.490
Huh?

13:07.490 --> 13:09.200
The first Nean...

13:09.200 --> 13:13.860
Wait, how long ago did
the Visitors come here, again?

13:14.330 --> 13:15.350
Oh...

13:15.350 --> 13:16.730
What's your point?

13:16.730 --> 13:19.140
I did think you were older than me,
but not that much...

13:19.140 --> 13:20.960
What, wanna speak to me formally then?

13:20.960 --> 13:22.500
Relative resonance.

13:22.500 --> 13:24.010
Meaningless concurrence.

13:24.010 --> 13:25.610
Over-synchronise.

13:26.490 --> 13:29.290
By acting together with Rouge Redstar,

13:29.290 --> 13:32.830
First's thought pattern is estimated
to have undergone a change.

13:32.830 --> 13:36.250
Yet, her deducing capabilities remain logical.

13:36.250 --> 13:38.840
This does not hamper the mission.

13:39.170 --> 13:43.000
It is logical to bring
Rouge Redstar to this ship.

13:43.000 --> 13:46.100
It is logical to visit this ship.

13:46.100 --> 13:49.990
In short, until the case is solved,
they need you to stay here.

13:49.990 --> 13:50.850
What?

13:51.750 --> 13:55.610
Your id contains the key
to deciphering Code Eve.

13:56.390 --> 13:57.260
Jill...

13:57.790 --> 14:00.260
Sylvia also said the same thing.

14:00.260 --> 14:01.480
Is that true?

14:01.480 --> 14:02.240
Yes.

14:02.520 --> 14:05.950
Which is why keeping you here is safe.

14:06.260 --> 14:08.590
You're locking me up here?

14:09.100 --> 14:11.370
So you're betraying me again?

14:11.780 --> 14:14.680
The Visitors won't interfere
with the earthlings,

14:14.680 --> 14:17.060
and they won't limit their actions either.

14:17.440 --> 14:20.460
I'm telling you, you'll be safest here.

14:20.460 --> 14:21.880
Safest, you say?

14:22.160 --> 14:23.460
If you guys won't interfere,

14:23.460 --> 14:26.940
then the Neans and Code Eve
have nothing to do with you, right?

14:26.940 --> 14:30.770
It is estimated that the Altar
is related to the Usurpers.

14:31.060 --> 14:33.410
If Code Eve activates,

14:33.410 --> 14:37.050
all the Neans will be freed out of control.

14:37.050 --> 14:39.060
With the chaos it brings,

14:39.060 --> 14:43.450
the Visitors think the Usurpers
will bring forth another war.

14:44.260 --> 14:47.270
The Usurpers are aiming
for this solar system.

14:47.270 --> 14:51.460
They are trying to destroy the Visitors
and humanity, aiming for a certain planet.

14:51.960 --> 14:54.890
And Sylvia and the others are also there.

14:56.800 --> 14:58.130
Venus...

14:58.460 --> 14:59.560
Bullseye.

15:00.220 --> 15:04.380
The planet with the most Neans
in the solar system currently.

15:04.770 --> 15:05.600
I understand.

15:06.250 --> 15:09.600
So you want them to bring you
your base for rebellion.

15:10.110 --> 15:11.740
That's not all.

15:11.740 --> 15:14.920
We Neans were born for that planet.

15:15.720 --> 15:18.260
As the starting place
of a new world,

15:18.260 --> 15:21.000
nothing better than Venus for that.

15:21.620 --> 15:23.740
Neans were born for Venus?

15:24.140 --> 15:25.110
What do you mean?

15:25.110 --> 15:28.620
We Zenoa once lost our home planet.

15:28.960 --> 15:31.060
Seeking for another to call home,

15:31.060 --> 15:33.670
we continued our journey forever.

15:34.020 --> 15:36.700
Then we came upon this star system.

15:37.140 --> 15:40.130
And we forged a contract with the humans.

15:40.520 --> 15:44.390
Zenoa will offer technology
humans have yet to reach.

15:44.390 --> 15:47.060
Humans will offer a habitable planet,

15:47.060 --> 15:49.620
in which Zenoa can live
with their original form.

15:49.620 --> 15:51.390
And that is Venus.

15:51.390 --> 15:53.700
Restructuring another planet together,

15:53.700 --> 15:57.390
humanity has allowed Zenoa
to move to Venus.

15:57.390 --> 15:59.650
Then, came the Neans as workforce.

15:59.980 --> 16:03.390
Those created with the technology from Zenoa.

16:03.390 --> 16:05.770
Huh? Hang on.

16:05.770 --> 16:08.100
So in order to have Venus,

16:08.100 --> 16:10.530
you taught humans
how to create Neans?

16:10.970 --> 16:13.140
So they got your technology,

16:13.140 --> 16:15.660
and created Neans
to have them work on Venus?

16:16.090 --> 16:20.140
Not to mention, the Usurpers are
about to cause a riot among Neans...

16:20.140 --> 16:21.540
And using that chance...

16:21.910 --> 16:25.980
The Unoid humans call the Usurpers
are dangerous beings.

16:25.980 --> 16:28.760
They came from the same origin as us Zenoa,

16:28.760 --> 16:31.620
but they have evolved into
a destructive evil civilisation.

16:31.990 --> 16:34.770
Unoid also seek Venus.

16:35.100 --> 16:37.460
As long as they are under human management,

16:37.460 --> 16:40.520
Neans will become
the force against Unoid.

16:40.860 --> 16:44.610
What the heck? Both humans and you
are using Neans as tools...

16:44.610 --> 16:47.450
Having them fight those
you don't want to...

16:47.450 --> 16:49.940
Neans are made for such purpose.

16:49.940 --> 16:52.640
We admit they are logically purposeful.

16:52.640 --> 16:53.990
Logically...?

16:54.680 --> 16:56.250
But that...

16:56.660 --> 16:57.810
That's just...

16:58.520 --> 17:00.080
That's just nonsense!

17:10.164 --> 17:12.836
How are things on Venus?

17:13.836 --> 17:15.710
Is there anything from
the Venus Development Group?

17:15.710 --> 17:16.836
Chief!

17:16.960 --> 17:18.836
A report from the Suborbital Section!

17:20.560 --> 17:22.836
The Usurpers from Jupiter
are on the move!

17:26.836 --> 17:27.164
Simultaneous invasion?!

17:36.190 --> 17:38.180
The enemy's main force is on the move.

17:38.180 --> 17:40.620
We're DEFCON 1 against the Usurpers.

17:40.890 --> 17:42.990
God, another war?

17:44.910 --> 17:46.840
I don't remember asking anyone to visit.

17:48.420 --> 17:49.530
Who are you?

17:50.880 --> 17:52.220
Hey...

17:54.990 --> 17:56.680
Now is my time to ask.

17:56.680 --> 17:58.660
Why did you betray me?

17:58.660 --> 18:00.810
Why did you hand me over
to the Protection Bureau?

18:01.160 --> 18:02.390
About that...

18:02.390 --> 18:04.140
Don't give me that!

18:04.140 --> 18:06.670
That was the safest way.

18:06.990 --> 18:10.010
Or else, you'd get disassembled instantly.

18:10.460 --> 18:13.350
You should talk to me
before acting yourself.

18:13.790 --> 18:14.780
Sorry.

18:16.260 --> 18:17.660
Let me hit you once.

18:17.950 --> 18:18.690
What?

18:18.690 --> 18:21.390
You don't know how tiring it was!

18:21.390 --> 18:23.180
They put me in strange water,

18:23.180 --> 18:25.140
and they cut me off Nectar!

18:25.140 --> 18:26.820
- Also, something about phase earlier...
- All right, all right.

18:26.820 --> 18:27.830
- You just kept yapping nonsense!
- All right, all right.

18:27.830 --> 18:29.500
- You just kept yapping nonsense!
- Just hit me lightly, okay?

18:29.500 --> 18:31.260
Unlike you, I...

18:33.940 --> 18:36.300
Urgh...

18:36.780 --> 18:39.790
Unlike you, I'm not so tough...

18:40.300 --> 18:42.520
Not the fist, will you?!

18:43.460 --> 18:45.440
You'll come with me, right?

18:48.710 --> 18:51.400
You'll be in danger
if I'm not around, anyway.

18:51.760 --> 18:52.970
Shut up.

18:55.740 --> 18:58.120
With that said,
we'll excuse ourselves.

18:58.460 --> 19:00.190
Where are you headed?

19:00.190 --> 19:01.750
Of course, Venus.

19:02.050 --> 19:07.160
Dangerous. It is logical for
Rouge Redstar to stay here.

19:07.160 --> 19:09.940
We recommend that she remain here.

19:09.940 --> 19:11.250
Yeah, sure.

19:11.250 --> 19:13.180
Even as great as they are,

19:13.180 --> 19:16.010
the Usurpers can't just lay hands
on Orbital City that easily.

19:16.460 --> 19:18.460
If Rouge Redstar is here,

19:18.460 --> 19:22.250
Code Eve won't activate,
and that makes it safe.

19:22.250 --> 19:23.450
Indeed.

19:23.450 --> 19:24.270
However...

19:24.570 --> 19:28.220
With the danger that Venus may fall
into the hands of the Usurpers now,

19:28.220 --> 19:33.460
I want to bet that Rouge Redstar
can solve this situation with her power.

19:34.970 --> 19:37.910
I advise it is also logical.

19:44.460 --> 19:48.920
We Zenoa cannot interfere with
an individual determination.

19:49.480 --> 19:51.740
Hence, we will approve.

19:52.070 --> 19:56.560
We will begin considering a backup plan
in case First's proposal fails.

19:56.560 --> 19:57.930
Thank you.

19:59.560 --> 20:03.430
I will go together with
Rouge Redstar and do my best.

20:03.770 --> 20:06.890
We cannot allow First to head to Venus.

20:07.620 --> 20:10.530
First's roles are limited
to contact with humans,

20:10.530 --> 20:12.650
and negotiate with them.

20:12.650 --> 20:14.760
Fighting is not among them.

20:17.090 --> 20:20.820
I request a day off right here.

20:22.040 --> 20:23.080
Day off?

20:23.360 --> 20:27.000
I haven't had a day off work
since I was born.

20:27.000 --> 20:28.540
By taking a day off,

20:28.540 --> 20:32.650
it has been proven scientifically
that it can improve work efficiency.

20:32.650 --> 20:34.750
Here's the data.

20:37.140 --> 20:38.970
We admit it is logical.

20:39.500 --> 20:41.340
Thank you.

20:42.820 --> 20:45.500
I'm surprised you can get along
with such fellows.

20:45.500 --> 20:47.480
You just gotta get used to it...

20:47.790 --> 20:49.120
But...

20:49.120 --> 20:53.140
I guess they'll still send me
my paycheck on my day off.

20:56.910 --> 20:57.490
So...

20:57.940 --> 20:59.650
How do we go to Venus?

20:59.650 --> 21:01.020
About that...

21:03.710 --> 21:05.750
All's well that ends well!

21:15.710 --> 21:16.420
Yo.

21:16.770 --> 21:17.460
Ah...
